  "description": "Adventure in its fastest form. The pointy end of gravel is faster, lighter, and more capable than ever. This is where the GVR is built to do battle. It features our most advanced and highest-grade carbon frame, designed from the ground up to unleash the most potent combination of tire clearance, aerodynamics, and low weight. Made to Push Every Limit Aero frame shapes cheat the wind for more efficiency. Lower weight makes mountains into molehills. Gravel suspension forks let shredders send it harder. Extra mounts increase carrying capacity for epic endurance races and all-day adventures. Tuned for Telepathic Handling Speed requires balance. The GVR is designed for high-speed confidence with the stability and manners to plow faster through the roughest terrain and rail loose corners, plus enough agility to make instant line-changes when your heart rate is pinned. Designed for Tire Geeks Tires are everything. The GVR is designed to take advantage of the enhanced speed, comfort, and puncture protection of super-wide gravel and MTB tires. Easily fit massive 56mm or 2.2” tires in the rear and even larger tires in the front.",
